[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9302.07, "timestamp": "02:35:02", "text": "我知道这会很乱，我会把东西放进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9305.469, "timestamp": "02:35:05", "text": "也进入其他房间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9309.63, "timestamp": "02:35:09", "text": "很快，一个房间就完工了，接下来是这个想法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9312.03, "timestamp": "02:35:12", "text": "呃，我们应该把它们全部完成吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9315.469, "timestamp": "02:35:15", "text": "或者你知道吗，好吧，我们随机一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9316.269, "timestamp": "02:35:16", "text": "做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9320.469, "timestamp": "02:35:20", "text": "这太酷了，我的天啊，等等，我什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9321.83, "timestamp": "02:35:21", "text": "这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9324.51, "timestamp": "02:35:24", "text": "凉爽的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9328.75, "timestamp": "02:35:28", "text": "哦，好的，我们去最底下吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9329.83, "timestamp": "02:35:29", "text": "一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9331.79, "timestamp": "02:35:31", "text": "书"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9333.59, "timestamp": "02:35:33", "text": "黄色的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9340.07, "timestamp": "02:35:40", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9350.07, "timestamp": "02:35:50", "text": "东西 h"}]